        "source_row": 4,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_e5da7411",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "「角」手握时序之能，时流常伴其身，岁月瀚海于祂而言不过是泥沼浅滩，一朝乘云而去，只消一瞬，天地间便已日月更替，星移斗转。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 4,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 5,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_0f5ceb0f",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "「四时有序，万物有常，是为天之道。」",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
